{"availability":"available","full":"harrythentrepreneur/emotional-circumplex-viz","name":"emotional-circumplex-viz","description":"Emotions drawn as glowing, organic blobs that blend into each other. Interactive D3.js circumplex with a live demo.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-08-17T08:42:33Z","updated":"2026-10-08T17:43:41Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://harrythentrepreneur.github.io/emotional-circumplex-viz/","topics":["d3","data-visualization","emotions","nextjs","typescript"],"demo":"https://harrythentrepreneur.github.io/emotional-circumplex-viz/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T04:03:44.985Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-20T04:03:44.985Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-20T04:03:44.985Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:01:44.150Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:49:04.695Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-20T04:03:44.985Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Try the live demo · Quick start · Customisation","An interactive D3.js chart that draws emotions on a circle as soft, glowing blobs. Each emotion has a colour, an intensity and an area of influence. Where two emotions overlap, their colours mix through a CSS blend mode, so a mood like \"hopeful but anxious\" shows as a mix of both colours.","I built it while I was looking at emotional patterns and wanted something nicer to look at than a bar chart. Use it, fork it, or take the blob renderer for your own project."],"features":["16 emotions, each with its own colour","Blobs are drawn pixel by pixel on a canvas, with a wavy edge so no two look the same","Overlaps mix with the screen, multiply, overlay or normal blend mode","Opacity slider and blend-mode picker in the page","Staggered D3 transitions: the blobs grow in, then the labels and percentage dots appear"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/harrythentrepreneur/emotional-circumplex-viz/